{"title":"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Factoring)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Factoring)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution(1-16)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution(1-16)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the graph of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/8/b08d4f9c466fcdf14dadf8773712ed69b072c229.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^4+1=x^4+2y^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"141\" height=\"20\" /> in the coordinate plane?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/c/8cc8b4c33e698bdbc6fef487521ed1e4ba03accb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } \\text{two intersecting parabolas} \\qquad \\textbf{(B) } \\text{two nonintersecting parabolas} \\qquad \\textbf{(C) } \\text{two intersecting circles} \\qquad \\\\\\\\ \\textbf{(D) } \\text{a circle and a hyperbola} \\qquad \\textbf{(E) } \\text{a circle and two parabolas}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"58\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the equation has even powers of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/9/919521ced5acdd82f6aedc7e8d82569df0d585b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&#39;=y^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"54\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/2/712139c426886f3e9b0eb764d8f39e9968a9435f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&#39; = x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"17\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/0/c90097967368ab53c7f00b60b2b91a92affb621a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&#39;^2 + 1 = x&#39;^2 + 2y&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"145\" height=\"20\" />. Rearranging gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/4/964a7416073c1ccacec726f65a22ec21b129e18a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&#39;^2 - 2y&#39; + 1 = x&#39;^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"145\" height=\"20\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/8/4c8972a37af5b2e198ef7755442115abe7c124d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(y&#39;-1)^2=x&#39;^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"115\" height=\"21\" />. There are two cases: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/c/aec15e50dbe5e28f22afae8fb0e43df5f964554a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&#39; \\leq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"49\" height=\"19\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/c/efc1c07db9137662ef1310c2621c1c527a3b16b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&#39; &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"49\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/c/aec15e50dbe5e28f22afae8fb0e43df5f964554a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&#39; \\leq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"49\" height=\"19\" />, taking the square root of both sides gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/e/21ebb8c47fe3935671c48f141cf2d9a443167666.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 - y&#39; = x&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"87\" height=\"19\" />, and rearranging gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/5/db538980d918c60b43c9e898ff9b17482a56922b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&#39; + y&#39; = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"87\" height=\"19\" />. Substituting back in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/e/f7ee1db867c31c4213dd5e70a6a751aefb9ee75b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&#39;=x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/9/919521ced5acdd82f6aedc7e8d82569df0d585b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&#39;=y^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"54\" height=\"18\" /> gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/d/f1dd4184b561ea747be652fc3dee7fc5e1c5103f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+y^2=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"89\" height=\"18\" />, the equation for a circle.\n</p><p>Similarly, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/c/efc1c07db9137662ef1310c2621c1c527a3b16b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&#39; &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"49\" height=\"19\" />, we take the square root of both sides to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/2/5322c36077d9937f35fc53ff5e6bafd86cffc756.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&#39; - 1 = x&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"87\" height=\"19\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/0/f209ba05b3381912beb86ba37979f53724a77d5d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&#39; - x&#39; = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"87\" height=\"19\" />, which is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/8/a88ec66b44e6decb2f0f9757d27fa50ceb4a5c7c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2 - x^2 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"92\" height=\"20\" />, a hyperbola.\n</p><p>Hence, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/0/dd0028efe79cc3b0dae1757851d2f55e2cb816ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{a circle and a hyperbola}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"224\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Bxiao31415\" title=\"User:Bxiao31415\">Bxiao31415</a>\n</p><p>(Solutions 1 and 2 are in essence the same; Solution 1 lets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/b/0ab0d817426f5f8783617cdc5d822a3fdb3e5f21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x&#39;,y&#39;)=\\left(x^2,y^2\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"137\" height=\"23\" /> for convenience, but the two solutions are otherwise identical.) \n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Factoring.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Factoring)\">Solution 2 (Factoring)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Factoring)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/2/8c2bd498e24c421e25e12e1478e48227efa53ee6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"24\" height=\"18\" /> from both sides and factor the left side to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/0/8b0325f0bd92b228906e397a41e980d968222b78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(y^2-1)^2 = x^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"114\" height=\"21\" />. If we take the square root of both sides, we are left with two equations: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/7/1877ca5ba159e0fa597ccf87433ad450f1fd7fcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2-1 = x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"92\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/f/d7fdcef514f8425e8df06e5fff27db157fef9e58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2-1 = -x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"106\" height=\"20\" />. In the former case, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/1/9613aea421702d8c48d00540bcd51930f0e11722.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2-x^2=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"92\" height=\"20\" />, which, is the formula for a hyperbola. This means that a hyperbola will appear in the graph of the equation. In the latter case, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/d/f1dd4184b561ea747be652fc3dee7fc5e1c5103f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+y^2=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"89\" height=\"18\" />, which is the equation of a circle which will also appear in the graph. Looking at our options, this is the only valid answer. Hence, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/0/dd0028efe79cc3b0dae1757851d2f55e2cb816ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{a circle and a hyperbola}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"224\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~mathman239458\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution.281-16.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution(1-16)\">Video Solution(1-16)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution(1-16)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/SCwQ9jUfr0g\">https://youtu.be/SCwQ9jUfr0g</a>\n</p><p>~~Hayabusa1\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>See <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.desmos.com/calculator/wmaqu3sbh3\">https://www.desmos.com/calculator/wmaqu3sbh3</a> for a diagram. Note how one could mistakenly answer (A) by plotting simple points. ~GAMER100\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B\">2022 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_15\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_18\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_20\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_22\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_23\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017144040\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 251/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2294/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 154/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5907/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   15.236      1 -total\n 52.71%    8.031      1 Template:AMC12_box\n 45.80%    6.978      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:23375:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017144040 and revision id 261645. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}